{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的整块话能直接呈现人物状态、原因和转折；X 单看高亮词组，常需要依靠上下文才能拼出完整意思。small：Y 的感受和旁注按音乐进程补入，与对应段落贴合，能提供额外信息；core：X 更完整地交代独自承担的现实、对旧日归属的怀念，以及不愿再为留住别人而吞下委屈的行动落点。concise：X 虽也有少量重复，但 Y 在 S02、S04、S10 等处大小字重复舍不得、旧日亲近、没有答案等意思，旁注也较密。human：X 的句法、指代和前后关系更自然，Y 的「把眼下过稳」「不只为有人陪回头」等搭配或省略显得生硬。fine：X 的「不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了」「那扇门又出现了」等表达更具体、有辨识度；Y 部分感受落在「解脱」「希望」等较笼统的表达上。load：X 的高亮短语短小，多落在自然意群边界；Y 在 S03、S11、S12 等短停留屏内连续出现多个较长大块，扫读更赶。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f9c3d00-2564-4f3d-a787-82f493945378", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T223741089431Z", "elapsed_seconds": 214.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:41:15.878158+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7f19503a4c775c6309a11ed700d0188e97e067f2ab1d92c1c390b0eef9cbcb6e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d9